♪ It's not, ♪

00:09:04.768 --> 00:09:06.771
♪ It's kinda light pink like Rosé ♪

00:09:06.771 --> 00:09:09.138
♪ The wine that you
might get in your glass ♪

00:09:09.138 --> 00:09:10.635
♪ Oh, she's left on her own ♪

00:09:10.635 --> 00:09:11.891
♪ That is not a laugh ♪

00:09:11.891 --> 00:09:12.866
