00:09:23.717 --> 00:09:26.591
♪ Waiting for her pet mummy to come home ♪

00:09:26.591 --> 00:09:28.049
♪ She's not a real child ♪

00:09:28.049 --> 00:09:29.507
♪ Leave her well alone ♪

00:09:29.507 --> 00:09:30.340
♪ She's over there ♪

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.526
♪ She's fine on her own ♪

00:09:31.526 --> 00:09:32.359
♪ Tell the truth ♪

00:09:32.359 --> 00:09:33.192
♪ When you leave the house ♪

00:09:33.192 --> 00:09:35.374
♪ She goes, "Celebrate with a 'woof'" ♪

00:09:35.374 --> 00:09:38.707
